DXE core half of mu_basecore 28a715f26c81 "m5: preserve DXE handoff state for J813"
(framebuffer checkpoints 0x30..0x38 through PcdBootArgsPointer, and the AURDXE01
breadcrumb gAuroraDxeTrace in CoreStartImage), plus the #Override tag line.

Applied at build time, never inside the submodule: PlatformBuildCommon's
PlatformPreBuild extracts MdeModulePkg/Core/Dxe from MU_BASECORE at the gitlink the
superproject pins (git archive), normalises it to LF, applies this patch with
git apply --check then git apply, and writes the result to the git-ignored
AppleSiliconPkg/Override/Generated/MdeModulePkg/Core/Dxe. Paths below are relative
to MdeModulePkg/Core/Dxe. Regenerate the tag (OverrideValidation.py -m) and this
patch together when MU_BASECORE moves.

